VIDING A LOW-EMISSIONS ALTERNATIVE TO DIESEL MACHINES TO CHARGE ELECTRIC VEHICLES, TOOLS, AND OTHER EQUIPMENT, ADVANCING WORKSITE ELECTRIFICATION STRATEGIES. UNITED RENTALS ACQUIRED THE GENERATORS FROM EVERGREEN MOBILE POWER."}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2023-04-18 09:30:00', 'title': "VERIZON CONTINUES TO UPGRADE NASHVILLE'S BEST NETWORK", 'text': 'RECENT UPGRADES LEAD TO TESTING RESULTS THAT SHOW VERIZON CUSTOMERS HAVE THE BEST NETWORK EXPERIENCE IN NASHVILLE RECENT UPGRADES LEAD TO TESTING RESULTS THAT SHOW VERIZON CUSTOMERS HAVE THE BEST NETWORK EXPERIENCE IN NASHVILLE'}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2023-04-18 09:00:00', 'title': 'VERIZON EXPANDS HIGH-SPEED INTERNET ACROSS MARYLAND', 'text': 'UNDERSERVED MARYLAND RESIDENTS AND BUSINESSES ACROSS THE STATE TO GET ACCESS TO FIOS INTERNET UNDERSERVED MARYLAND RESIDENTS AND BUSINESSES ACROSS THE STATE TO GET ACCESS TO FIOS INTERNET'}{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2023-04-18 08:15:00', 'title': 'WALMART TEAMS UP WITH CUMMINS AND CHEVRON TO DEBUT FIRST 15-LITER RENEWABLE NATURAL GAS ENGINE ON THE ROAD IN NORTH AMERICA', 'text': "BENTONVILLE, ARK. & SAN RAMON, CALIF. & COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WALMART IS REACHING A NEW DESTINATION IN ITS GOAL FOR A ZERO-EMISSIONS TRANSPORTATION FLEET WITH THE DEBUT OF THE FIRST NORTH AMERICAN—AND THE FIRST OF FIVE— 15-LITER COMPRESSED NATURAL GAS ENGINE THAT WILL BE INCORPORATED INTO WALMART'S PRIVATE FLEET. THE X15N™ ENGINE IS SUPPLIED BY CUMMINS AND FUELED BY CHEVRON WITH COMPRESSED NATURAL GAS (CNG) LINKED TO RENEWABLE NATURAL GAS."}{'symbol': 'WHR', 'date': '2023-04-18 11:22:00', 'title': 'WHIRLPOOL CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'BENTON HARBOR, MICH. , APRIL 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF WHIRLPOOL CORPORATION (THE "COMPANY") DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.75 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY\'S COMMON STOCK.'}{'symbol': 'WTW', 'date': '2023-04-18 04:02:00', 'title': "POLITICAL RISK LOSS FREQUENCY SURGES IN 2022 TO BECOME “EVERYONE'S RISK” AS UKRAINE WAR DELIVERS WIDESPREAD FINANCIAL LOSSES", 'text': "LONDON, APRIL 18, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NINE OUT OF TEN COMPANIES HAVE SUFFERED A POLITICAL RISK LOSS IN THE PAST YEAR, TRANSFORMING POLITICAL RISK FROM A LOW FREQUENCY, HIGH SEVERITY PERIL INTO “EVERYONE'S RISK,” ACCORDING TO HOW ARE GLOBAL BUSINESSES MANAGING TODAY'S POLITICAL RISKS A NEW REPORT BY WTW (NASDAQ: WTW), A LEADING GLOBAL ADVISORY, BROKING, AND SOLUTIONS COMPANY."}{'symbol': 'WTW', 'date': '2023-04-18 04:00:00', 'title': 'WTW APPOINTS MY THIEN NGUYEN AS COUNTRY LEADER AND HEAD OF CORPORATE RISK & BROKING IN VIETNAM', 'text': 'SINGAPORE, APRIL 18, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- WTW (NASDAQ: WTW), A LEADING GLOBAL ADVISORY, BROKING AND SOLUTIONS COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF MY THIEN NGUYEN AS COUNTRY LEADER AND HEAD OF CORPORATE RISK & BROKING FOR VIETNAM, EFFECTIVE 1 AUGUST 2023. THIEN SUCCEEDS PHILIPPE ROBINEAU WHO WILL LEAVE WTW ON 31 JULY.'}